        },
        {
          "text": " Aga nigo mahanga agu MUKAMA yaatsigireho kurengyesa Abaisraeli, nibo Baisraeli boona abaabaire batamanyiire ngamba zoona ez'omuri Kanaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngu ab'obusingye bwona bw'Abaisraeli bamanyiire engamba, kandi okukira munonga ayegyese abo abaabaire batakarwanaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo nibo bakama bataano b'Abafilistia, n'Abanyakanaani boona, n'Abasidoni, n'Abahiivi, abaabaire batwire omu kibungo kya Lebanooni, okuruga aha rushozi rwa Baali-herumooni okuhika ah'orikutaahira nooza Hamasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaba bari ab'okurengyesa Abaisraeli okumanya ku baraabe nibaija kworobera ebiragiro bya MUKAMA, ebi yaaragiire baishenkurubo naaraba omuri Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo Abaisraeli baatuura hamwe n'Abanyakanaani n'Abahiiti n'Abaamori n'Abaperizi n'Abahiivi n'Abayebusi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
