          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehudi ku yaashohoire, abaheereza b'omugabe baija, baashanga enyigi z'ekyo kishengye zikingire; baateekateeka ngu agiire aha ishaazi omu kishengye ky'amabeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baategyereza okuhitsya obu baitsirwe enshoni; n'ahabw'ekyo baatwara ekishumuruzo, baaziigura, baashanga mukama waabo agangarami ahansi afiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku baabaire bakiri aheeru bategyereize, Ehudi yaacwa, yaaraba aha bishushani by'amabaare, yaahungira Seira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
