            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaahikireyo, yaateerera enzamba omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu, Abaisraeli baashuuma nawe, nibaruga omuri ebyo bibungo, abeembeire. ",
          "type": "text",
